   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: SPF from S without S–E, ties to the lowest router ids",
   "originalText": "The rule: SPF from S without S–E, ties to the lowest router ids",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 837,
   "height": 38,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "post-convergence path  =  shortest path S → D  in the graph without S–E (both ways)\ntie  →  compare the paths router by router from S; the lowest id at the first difference wins",
   "originalText": "post-convergence path  =  shortest path S → D  in the graph without S–E (both ways)\ntie  →  compare the paths router by router from S; the lowest id at the first difference wins",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 214,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  It is the cheapest path that avoids the failure, and the one S will use once the network has\n   reconverged. So traffic moves once, not twice (RFC 9855 §3).\n•  TI-LFA then forces the packet along it with segments (B15). The repair costs exactly the\n   post-convergence cost.\n•  The tie-break is ours: the RFC only asks for the post-convergence path. A fixed rule gives the same\n   answer every run (project rule 1), and the drawings, Explain and the simulation (A9) all use it.",
   "originalText": "•  It is the cheapest path that avoids the failure, and the one S will use once the network has\n   reconverged. So traffic moves once, not twice (RFC 9855 §3).\n•  TI-LFA then forces the packet along it with segments (B15). The repair costs exactly the\n   post-convergence cost.\n•  The tie-break is ours: the RFC only asks for the post-convergence path. A fixed rule gives the same\n   answer every run (project rule 1), and the drawings, Explain and the simulation (A9) all use it.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 352,
   "width": 384,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 5, the tie (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Example 5, the tie (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 386,
   "width": 657,
   "height": 94,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Path                    Cost   Router by router      Result\n----------------------  -----  --------------------  -------------------\nSP1 → L2 → SP2 → L1     30     SP1, L2, …            chosen: L2 < L3 < L4\nSP1 → L3 → SP2 → L1     30     SP1, L3, …            loses at hop 2\nSP1 → L4 → SP2 → L1     30     SP1, L4, …            loses at hop 2",
   "originalText": "Path                    Cost   Router by router      Result\n----------------------  -----  --------------------  -------------------\nSP1 → L2 → SP2 → L1     30     SP1, L2, …            chosen: L2 < L3 < L4\nSP1 → L3 → SP2 → L1     30     SP1, L3, …            loses at hop 2\nSP1 → L4 → SP2 → L1     30     SP1, L4, …            loses at hop 2",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
