   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "When there is none",
   "originalText": "When there is none",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 798,
   "width": 477,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 388031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5131721,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "If D can’t be reached without S–E, the link is a\nbridge for D: the network is split and nothing can\nprotect it.",
   "originalText": "If D can’t be reached without S–E, the link is a\nbridge for D: the network is split and nothing can\nprotect it.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-50",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 872,
   "width": 493,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 395950,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5236450,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 10: R5 hangs off R4 alone. R4 → R5 and R5 →\nevery other router are \"partitioned\" in the unprotected\nlist (A8).",
   "originalText": "Example 10: R5 hangs off R4 alone. R4 → R5 and R5 →\nevery other router are \"partitioned\" in the unprotected\nlist (A8).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-rectangle-51",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 742,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 208,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 403869,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5341179,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 760,
   "width": 296,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 411788,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5445908,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The best backup there is",
   "originalText": "The best backup there is",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-text-53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 798,
   "width": 486,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 419707,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5550637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "It is the cheapest: no path without S–E costs less.\nLFA and Remote LFA may take a longer detour (A9\nmarks those \"longer\"). With one link down, a TI-LFA\nrepair is always the same path as S’s final one\n(link mode).",
   "originalText": "It is the cheapest: no path without S–E costs less.\nLFA and Remote LFA may take a longer detour (A9\nmarks those \"longer\"). With one link down, a TI-LFA\nrepair is always the same path as S’s final one\n(link mode).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b14-rectangle-54",
